        Got one variable that could
        be lots of different things? Use a switch! It takes a single value and checks
        it against a list of ''cases'' until it finds a perfect match.

        Example:
        switch (doorColor) { case "Red": / Fire Room / break; case "Blue": / Water
        Room / break; }"'
